@startuml sequence
title 이벤트 로그 저장 순차 다이어그램

actor "Client" as Client
participant "EventLogController" as Controller
participant "EventLogService" as Service
participant "EventLogRepository" as Repository
database "Database" as DB

Client -> Controller: POST /api/v1/event-logs
activate Controller

Controller -> Service: save(request)
activate Service

Service -> Repository: insert(request)
activate Repository

Repository -> DB: INSERT INTO event_log ...
activate DB
DB --> Repository: return
deactivate DB

Repository --> Service: return
deactivate Repository

Service --> Controller: return
deactivate Service

Controller --> Client: 200 OK
deactivate Controller
@enduml
